            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585890/extras/a49df10fd3f0e572ad2c4670bb509815.avif?t=1728687943\" width=600 height=185 /></span><br>&quot;I love you for who you are. I’ve loved you from the moment I met you.&quot;<br><br>Robin Hawkins is down on his luck. His relationship with his wife, Sally, is stagnating, and his daughter, Melody, no longer speaks to him.<br>Stuck in an unsatisfying and draining job, Robin's life is one long, monotonous slog...<br>Until he meets the mysterious girl of his dreams in the middle of the night, Bell.<br>However, there is far more to Bell than meets the eye - and Robin's 'dreams' are fast in danger of becoming 'nightmares'.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585890/extras/c3fac340dcf0e11cdaa6e7031df0f717.avif?t=1728687943\" width=600 height=185 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This VN is kinetic. It has no choices/branches.<br></li><li>It's around 40k in length.<br></li><li>It contains fanservice, sexual content/nudity, and some psychological horror elements readers might find disturbing.<br></li><li>Features entirely custom art and OST.<br></li><li>Most importantly, contains a cute catgirl! ❤</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/585890/extras/ed2cc9b317d607431ffea9c7adc116c4.avif?t=1728687943\" width=400 height=467 /></span>",
